# Prettier is used in this project for MARKDOWN ONLY — see the `lint:md` /
# `lint:md:fix` scripts in package.json. It is deliberately NOT wired up for
# JavaScript or TypeScript: prettier's defaults (double quotes, 2-space indent)
# contradict this project's code standards (single quotes, 4-space indent), and
# there is intentionally no .prettierrc so that an editor's format-on-save does
# not silently start reformatting source files against those standards.

